sample_frames.py: sample 7 frames per video from data/dr_videos -> data/informative_frames/frames_raw_extract
grade_frames.py: UI to label those frames informative / not
crop_frames.py: crop them with the cropping ensemble, sort into 0/1 folders
classify_frames.py: 5-fold EfficientNet informative classifier on frames_cropped -> models/, folds in split_info_5fold_*.csv
extract_inf_frames.py: crop + filter all videos with both ensembles -> cleaned_videos + per-frame txts/plots

2026-10-14: data/ensemble_results_paxos2025/{cleaned_videos,plots,txt_files} replaced by an updated extraction
(https://uni-bonn.sciebo.de/s/jRc2RjGae7mjZwi). Same 417 videos/txt format; median informative frames 675 (was 406),
min 32 per clip (no padding). Renamed to CLEAN_* on import; old clips/frame_clusters/frame_maps deleted, frame_clusters rebuilt.
